{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Hit the hard reset button on your body. Detoxify is a heavy-duty, deep-cleansing bar built to strip away stubborn sweat, outdoor grime, and daily environmental buildup. It cuts right through surface oils and deep-seated impurities without drying you out, leaving your skin completely clean and refreshed.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>Built as a heavy-duty reset button for working bodies and athletes, Detoxify is a sturdy, deep-cleansing bar engineered to strip away stubborn sweat, outdoor grime, grease, and industrial buildup. It delivers a maximum-strength purge without using harsh chemical detergents.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Industrial Grime Removal: Effectively cuts through heavy engine oils, kitchen grease, stubborn soil, and dried sweat</li>
                    <li>Bacterial Decongestion: Sanitizes the skin surface to prevent body acne and irritation caused by trapped sweat under workout gear</li>
                    <li>Skin Refresh: Deeply purifies body pores, leaving the skin feeling entirely unburdened, clean, and breathing freely</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Oily, active, athletic, or grimy skin.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Goats Milk, Shea Butter, Bentonite Clay, Organic Frankincense Oil, Lemongrass Oil, Organic Patchouli Oil, Organic Grape Seed Oil, and Natural Preservative.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
